                    {
                        "sense_id": "2d5fe4fc-b77b-37d1-b4f2-fb66f003807a",
                        "entry_id": "e042b1ce-5370-3fea-8e7b-4344cb4d8b75",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Compensation paid by someone who killed their relative."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "historical",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "61b64b3c-09ea-44d2-ad86-2a321931b3ca",
                                "sense_id": "2d5fe4fc-b77b-37d1-b4f2-fb66f003807a",
                                "text": "As to the Cynegild or Mægbote, it appears also from Tacitus, that the whole Family received satisfaction for a Kinsman slain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7242dc3d-0af8-4cb4-ae1d-1041d3f5aefe",
                                "sense_id": "2d5fe4fc-b77b-37d1-b4f2-fb66f003807a",
                                "text": "If one kill another's Godson or Godfather, let the Magbote [to the Godfather, or Godson] and the Manbote be alike."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "61f40d69-33f6-4b43-a88f-cda8ab8ef262",
                                "sense_id": "2d5fe4fc-b77b-37d1-b4f2-fb66f003807a",
                                "text": "Now if the King had a Mind to remit his Part of the Fine the Frithbote, he could not give away that of the others, nor prevent the Kindred from receiving their Magbote or Family Compensation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
